46	    \item Goodfellow et al., ``Generative Adversarial Nets,'' NeurIPS 2014 --- GAN 的开创性论文
47	    \item Higgins et al., ``$\beta$-VAE: Learning Basic Visual Concepts with a Constrained Variational Framework,'' ICLR 2017
48	    \item Isola et al., ``Image-to-Image Translation with Conditional Adversarial Networks (Pix2Pix),'' CVPR 2017
49	    \item Karras et al., ``Progressive Growing of GANs,'' ICLR 2018
50	    \item Zhu et al., ``Unpaired Image-to-Image Translation using Cycle-Consistent Adversarial Networks (CycleGAN),'' ICCV 2017
51	    \item Brock et al., ``Large Scale GAN Training for High Fidelity Natural Image Synthesis (BigGAN),'' ICLR 2019
52	    \item Ho et al., ``Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models,'' NeurIPS 2020 --- Diffusion Models
53	    \item MIT 6.S191 课程主页：\href{https://introtodeeplearning.com}{introtodeeplearning.com}
